8&_nc_oc=AdlyS-uZHl-eq3xMjKlN9QeBVFPjY-SAfxvvqHtrOf_vAZY5tAUzp_4ikbor0C7PwDQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftI01fUt98kOHlJmRsVw5-34T-NuPIEu6TVPoHQNo3JPQ&oe=699C5030"}, {"file_name": "1.3_PuzzleLevel_028.png", "id": "1836994227070784", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391911_1836994230404117_1890935279929871499_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cdGfh8TiRvIQ7kNvwF7WUaI&_nc_oc=AdnAGvlfsV5zbQgQisz4OANfNDaTHOehp6qAgg07LfDy9T5q47f0_NKDAC41HHsUb5w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsL4HGOFrrQVo2dKHzomVSzh4XSTf3YEUW-pkGJ2a6XNA&oe=699C3707"}, {"file_name": "2.1_PuzzleLevel_023.png", "id": "980481747324553", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391934_980481753991219_471152226523097550_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UFOpniv46TcQ7kNvwGOHAc-&_nc_oc=Adn7f8Q5aaAr2ZZC080UFl5gcPlYORLqWeoqeGigOmraSDG8ttzqTTyymaUvZ1Brj1E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu3emF8pFTDjyUe1Jt5-fA2Y7CCKSMSj1v3VSiZtVNsYQ&oe=699C63E6"}, {"file_name": "2.2_PuzzleLevel_005.png", "id": "629250039801395", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392016_629250043134728_2118689073029424993_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zulVKIvldscQ7kNvwFoVQJZ&_nc_oc=AdnJImULaYpFywIubnwijYAjKsXMNFYk9xqoMN7h6lBCK0LMCN7GULfcy13aaBt-BdI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu8_RmNMfYA4n56zklFEnI8WIf7rjWjaQupJb5iknqnLQ&oe=699C5352"}, {"file_name": "2.3_PuzzleLevel_010_Vers3.png", "id": "640340928639659", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392016_640340931972992_938618552754180062_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aJvMu1R4RD4Q7kNvwFBiNVI&_nc_oc=AdnCM3SgISISW9FdsdZ7fIGZ8qeFMegUcZBbZkb2iUGPmha2Ggqk3Q2zrUuQlhErUtw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftNonT43cAGqLYG98iIWvAedbRbvhkOs-Scm1R6It-wcQ&oe=699C5F75"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "VersX.png", "id": "905403181768105", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035377_905403185101438_6180565823629151945_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WZNjo_1zjy0Q7kNvwHUPInF&_nc_oc=AdmB8nQiGM20_vqc3WTn-O056v0kxK7W9iSeqb--777HSXhGEbrQuSGlNKcJwLQ2G3g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsHF5gEM-j4C0vQHizU85CSIdjOkeICJzUfJkcmFENWDw&oe=699C6620"}, "display_name": "Selina: Mind at Large", "keywords": ["Puzzle", "Narrative", "Surreal", "Emotional", "Physics"], "long_description": "\nJump into the magic world of Selinas mind and master tricky physics-based puzzles to protect her memories from looming shadows and immerse yourself in a bittersweet tale about courage that will captivate your heart and mind!!\n\n{462054049934411}\n{3846354725676153}\n- Turn the world on it's head in a series of physics-based puzzles using the gravity defying *Escher-Teleport*\n\n- Embark on an heartwarming journey alongside Selina across otherworldly spaces of impossible architecture\n\n- Follow a moving tale about the shadows in our mind through fully animated character interactions\n\n\n\n{1270178880992449}\n\n{469944256054407}\n\n\n\n\n\n\nInfluenced by the writings of Carl Gustav Jung, ***Selina: Mind at Large*** is offering a unique and imaginative perspective into the mind of a child. Are you prepared to help Selina and push back against the sinister Aniles and her shadows?\n\n\n{1955927098148751}\n\n{655503446907375}\n\u201cSelina: Mind at Large attempts one of the most challenging tasks a game can achieve: transporting you into the shoes of a child. ... you return to feeling like a child yourself, in wonder for the gravity-changing hijinks that ensue, and the personal struggles underneath.. Isn\u2019t that what we want in games?\u201d - UploadVR\n\n{1358786278632654}\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Guide the magic waters of Selinas mind through tricky physics-based puzzles to protect her memories from looming shadows and immers